flowchart LR
  A[Candidate persisted] --> B{Permission + evidence valid?}
  B -- no --> X[Review only]
  B -- yes --> C[Shadow evaluation]
  C --> D{Parity + compensation + kill switch proved?}
  D -- no --> X
  D -- yes --> E[Stable tiny canary]
  E --> F{No reversals and bounded human edits?}
  F -- no --> G[Stop and investigate]
  F -- yes --> H[Owner-authorised expansion]
